Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:02.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You have 5 years before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.16,0:00:03.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.01,0:00:06.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A machine smarter than any human,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.28,0:00:07.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.89,0:00:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That means the biggest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.94,0:00:10.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}change in human history,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:11.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the shortest time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.09,0:00:13.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The plow changed
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:14.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the work of our hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.41,0:00:16.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The engine, our muscles.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The computer, our memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.94,0:00:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But thinking still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.05,0:00:20.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}needed a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.43,0:00:21.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.46,0:00:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And those changes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.28,0:00:23.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}took generations:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.61,0:00:25.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the children learned the new work.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.60,0:00:27.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This time, there is no next
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.23,0:00:28.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation to wait for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.76,0:00:29.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It falls to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.99,0:00:30.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So how do you get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.91,0:00:32.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ready in 5 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.99,0:00:35.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The change has already started.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.28,0:00:37.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Some insiders expect the first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:38.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superhuman AI as early
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:39.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}as next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.31,0:00:42.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But you have something almost no
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:43.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation got before
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.69,0:00:45.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its world changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:46.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.47,0:00:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The people building
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.34,0:00:48.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.45,0:00:50.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}named the deadline themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:51.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the first thing to get
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:53.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ready is not your computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.97,0:00:56.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Picture a wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:57.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A stranger at your
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}table asks what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.28,0:01:00.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You have the answer ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.71,0:01:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You have given it for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.97,0:01:03.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now picture giving
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.95,0:01:05.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a different one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:06.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:08.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The historian Yuval Noah
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.26,0:01:10.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari says you will have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.65,0:01:11.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He is no engineer,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.81,0:01:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and warnings like his sell books.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.30,0:01:15.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But hear him out:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.79,0:01:17.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And having to change again and
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:18.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}again throughout your life,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.65,0:01:20.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you cannot rely on just,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.87,0:01:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}okay, now I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.47,0:01:23.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}now I have the knowledge that will
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.79,0:01:25.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}keep me throughout my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.35,0:01:26.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}now I have the profession,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.51,0:01:29.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the job, I will do this until I'm
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.25,0:01:30.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}old.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:32.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.51,0:01:33.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He calls it the end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.70,0:01:35.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of lifetime careers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.47,0:01:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And he expects the change
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.80,0:01:38.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to go on for decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.69,0:01:40.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So start the countdown.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.51,0:01:42.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One step for each year.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.50,0:01:43.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the hardest question
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.75,0:01:45.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}waits at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.37,0:01:47.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}5 years to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:49.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first step is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:50.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It comes first because
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.90,0:01:52.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it takes the longest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.28,0:01:53.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it pays off even
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.47,0:01:54.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if the builders are wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.54,0:01:55.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.62,0:01:56.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}arrives much later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.59,0:01:59.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Reinvent yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.33,0:02:00.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:01.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It sounds like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.04,0:02:02.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a young person's game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.58,0:02:04.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The data disagrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.25,0:02:04.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Among America's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:06.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fastest-growing new companies,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.76,0:02:07.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the average founder
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.58,0:02:09.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was 45 at the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.52,0:02:10.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:11.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it matters who
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.96,0:02:13.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}chooses the change.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.03,0:02:15.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People who switch jobs
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.24,0:02:16.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}late in their careers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.77,0:02:18.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by their own choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.09,0:02:20.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}tend to end up more satisfied.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.48,0:02:21.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People laid off
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.31,0:02:23.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in their late 40s lose,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.28,0:02:24.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on average, more
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.33,0:02:26.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than a quarter of their pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is a comparison, not proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.98,0:02:29.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the same change
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.99,0:02:31.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is a different thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.39,0:02:32.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}chosen or forced.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:34.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What the next generation
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:36.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}always had was a fresh start.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:38.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So choose your own,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.45,0:02:40.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}while nothing depends on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.60,0:02:41.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Become a beginner
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.55,0:02:43.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at one thing this year,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:45.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and stay with the awkward part.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.55,0:02:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At work, take on one new
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:49.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}role before anyone asks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.46,0:02:50.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Join one group that has
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.82,0:02:52.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}never heard your job title.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.96,0:02:54.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If the title goes,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.25,0:02:55.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you are still somebody there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.25,0:02:58.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Resilience is partly practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.76,0:03:00.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So when the big change comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:02.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it will not be your first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.51,0:03:03.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But starting over
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.61,0:03:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is only half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.45,0:03:06.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If a machine can do
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.42,0:03:07.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your task in a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.10,0:03:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what is your
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}experience still worth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.49,0:03:12.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}4 years to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.07,0:03:14.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This step is your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.15,0:03:16.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And here, there
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.09,0:03:17.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is evidence on your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.82,0:03:19.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One AI company studied how
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.62,0:03:21.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}people work with its own tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.80,0:03:23.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Experts succeeded more
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.16,0:03:25.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than twice as often as beginners.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.44,0:03:27.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}With the same tool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.03,0:03:29.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In that study,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:30.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machine did not
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.25,0:03:31.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}level the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.63,0:03:32.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It rewarded the people
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.81,0:03:34.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who already knew the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.86,0:03:36.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Does that make you safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.63,0:03:37.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.79,0:03:39.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The study watched one coding tool,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.01,0:03:41.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not every trade.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.62,0:03:42.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And when people in their
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.42,0:03:44.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}late 50s and early 60s
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:45.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are out of work,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.46,0:03:48.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it lasts 34 weeks on average.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:50.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So experience is an edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not a guarantee.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.35,0:03:53.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And an edge only
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.40,0:03:55.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}counts if you use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.30,0:03:56.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Learn the machine on the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.91,0:03:58.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}while you still have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.53,0:04:00.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is your guard against
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.04,0:04:01.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}those weeks outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.03,0:04:02.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But you can only do
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.99,0:04:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so much on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.90,0:04:05.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This summer,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.76,0:04:07.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than 200 economists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.52,0:04:08.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and AI researchers
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.89,0:04:10.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}signed one statement.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not to pause.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.29,0:04:13.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}To prepare.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:14.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One of its organizers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:16.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Stanford's Erik Brynjolfsson,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}makes the case:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.39,0:04:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We feel there's a need to do this
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.55,0:04:21.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}because what we see is that
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.35,0:04:22.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}there's this growing gap between
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.95,0:04:25.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}amazing capabilities going faster
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.17,0:04:27.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and faster and relatively slow
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.07,0:04:28.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}changes in our economic
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.21,0:04:30.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}institutions and understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:32.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.62,0:04:33.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.11,0:04:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.03,0:04:36.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.15,0:04:37.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:39.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:40.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.39,0:04:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You met this machine as an adult.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.64,0:04:44.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But what about
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.44,0:04:45.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the next generation,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.75,0:04:47.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the people growing up with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.73,0:04:49.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}3 years to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.25,0:04:51.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This step is your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.19,0:04:52.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your children.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:53.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your grandchildren.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.60,0:04:55.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}3 in 4 teenagers use
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.47,0:04:56.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI in their free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.10,0:04:59.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most have tried an AI companion,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a chatbot you talk
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:01.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to like a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}California now has a law for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.63,0:05:04.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A companion chatbot
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.82,0:05:05.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}must tell a child,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.90,0:05:07.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at least every 3 hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.74,0:05:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that it is not a human being.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.66,0:05:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Somebody had to write
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that sentence into law.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.78,0:05:15.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari has a name for a generation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.90,0:05:17.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}growing up with machine friends:
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.11,0:05:19.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a psychological experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.88,0:05:21.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on a global scale.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.86,0:05:22.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And we already hear about
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:24.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}children. You ask them,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who is your best friend in the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.02,0:05:27.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}world? And they say,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.44,0:05:30.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the AI. There are things I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.24,0:05:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}tell my mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.04,0:05:33.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}there are things I don't tell my
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.52,0:05:34.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}friends in school,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.54,0:05:35.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}but I tell the AI.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.45,0:05:38.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This time, the next generation
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:40.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can't do the adapting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.67,0:05:41.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It needs you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The reflex is to forbid
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:44.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machine friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.08,0:05:46.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But a ban may only
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.17,0:05:47.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hide them from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.71,0:05:49.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So ask instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.56,0:05:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Which AI do you talk to?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:52.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.83,0:05:54.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is there one you'd call a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.85,0:05:55.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then ask to read
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.93,0:05:57.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one chat together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.49,0:05:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That protects against
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.52,0:05:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a relationship
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.33,0:06:00.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with a machine you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.15,0:06:01.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}know nothing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.93,0:06:03.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But if a machine can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.10,0:06:04.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}already act like a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.16,0:06:06.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}how close is the rest?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Are the 5 years even real?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:11.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}2 years to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.62,0:06:13.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This step is the machine itself:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.01,0:06:15.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what you actually know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:17.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}5 years to full
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.21,0:06:19.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}superintelligence is not a fact.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.74,0:06:20.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A short deadline helps
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.87,0:06:21.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a lab raise money,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.88,0:06:22.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and many outside
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.85,0:06:24.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}experts say much later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.90,0:06:25.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the experts have repeatedly
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.10,0:06:27.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}underestimated how
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.03,0:06:29.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fast this moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:31.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The chatbot most people know
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.15,0:06:33.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is not yet old enough for school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.27,0:06:34.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By its maker's count,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the accounts using
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.27,0:06:36.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it every week have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.31,0:06:37.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}passed a billion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.86,0:06:39.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And even most of their later dates
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.38,0:06:41.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are less than a generation away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.80,0:06:43.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So it is the deadline
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.18,0:06:44.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}worth preparing for.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.80,0:06:46.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If it takes longer,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.08,0:06:47.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you were early.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.21,0:06:49.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If it takes five, you were ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:51.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is what the experts know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.78,0:06:52.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:55.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Among Americans over 65,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.23,0:06:56.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more people expect AI
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:58.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to harm society than have
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.79,0:07:00.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ever tried a chatbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.36,0:07:02.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The fear arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before the experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.38,0:07:06.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So get the experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.49,0:07:08.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Give the machine one afternoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.30,0:07:09.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and a task you have
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}done for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.82,0:07:12.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There, you see at once
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.35,0:07:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where it shines,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.48,0:07:14.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and where it is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:15.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That protects you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.71,0:07:17.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from both stories:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.19,0:07:19.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the sales pitch, and the shrug.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:20.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It turns a vague
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:22.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fear into a judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:24.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The last step needs that judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:25.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because the rules for these
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:26.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machines are being
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.96,0:07:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}written right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.31,0:07:29.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not a generation from now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.13,0:07:30.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the biggest
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.77,0:07:32.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one is still blank:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:34.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who gets what the machines earn?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.18,0:07:37.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}1 year to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.62,0:07:39.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This step is your say.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.73,0:07:40.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Voters have already
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.67,0:07:42.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}started to use theirs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:44.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This November, limits on new data
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.22,0:07:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}centers were on local ballots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.15,0:07:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They won all but one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:49.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Those votes were about buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.93,0:07:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On the bigger question,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one answer comes from both
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.55,0:07:54.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ends of American politics:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.32,0:07:56.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}give the public a stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:57.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Senator Bernie Sanders
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.44,0:07:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has put it into a bill:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.87,0:08:00.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a public fund of AI shares
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.77,0:08:02.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that pays out to every American.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.88,0:08:04.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The bill's chances are slim.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:06.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But here is his argument:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.77,0:08:08.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}When a public resource generates
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:12.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}wealth, the public should share in
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.60,0:08:13.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that wealth.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.47,0:08:15.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Donald Trump has floated
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the idea too: "the American
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.79,0:08:19.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}public essentially becomes
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.37,0:08:21.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a partner with the companies."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.36,0:08:23.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Neither version is law.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.22,0:08:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So when this reaches
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:25.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your ballot, show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:27.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And ask everyone who wants
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:29.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your vote one question:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.47,0:08:31.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who gets a share of the gain?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.47,0:08:33.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Otherwise, others divide
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.09,0:08:34.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it without you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And there may be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.87,0:08:37.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a great deal to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:39.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Inside one AI company,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.59,0:08:40.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}9 in 10 of the staff
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.03,0:08:42.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}expect AI to be
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.23,0:08:44.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}capable of a Nobel-level discovery
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.35,0:08:46.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before this decade is out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.39,0:08:47.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They have a stake in that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.95,0:08:49.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But if even part of it comes true,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.07,0:08:51.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}these years bring discoveries,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.83,0:08:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not only risks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So suppose all of it works:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:57.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the discoveries, the rules,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.45,0:08:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the shared gain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That leaves the hardest question,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.68,0:09:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the one no ballot can settle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.96,0:09:04.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}5 years from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.07,0:09:05.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at another wedding,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.09,0:09:06.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a stranger asks what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:09.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who do you want to be,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.35,0:09:10.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}when nobody needs you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.59,0:09:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for your thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.03,0:09:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It can sound like a loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.07,0:09:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But listen again:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.48,0:09:16.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it is the question
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.28,0:09:17.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}we ask children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.86,0:09:19.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What do you want to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.33,0:09:20.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For most of history,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.68,0:09:21.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a change this big
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:23.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was left to the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This one is yours: the warning,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the work, and the wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.33,0:09:30.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There is no next
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.27,0:09:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation to wait for.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:33.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This time, the next
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.43,0:09:35.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}generation is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.21,0:09:37.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.36,0:09:38.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.72,0:09:40.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.63,0:09:42.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}For this generation, and the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.03,0:09:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.11,0:09:45.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
